{"content":[{"c":["MASSA"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Ishmael’s seventh son and Abraham’s grandson (",{"href":"?bref=Gen.25.14","r":"Gen.25.14","rawR":"Gen.25.14","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.25.14","value":"Gen.25.14"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gn 25:14"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.1.30","r":"1Chr.1.30","rawR":"1Chr.1.30","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.1.30","value":"1Chr.1.30"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 1:30"},"). His descendants inhabited northwestern Arabia. Tiglath-pileser III mentions these people, along with the inhabitants of Tema (cf. ",{"href":"?bref=Gen.25.15","r":"Gen.25.15","rawR":"Gen.25.15","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.25.15","value":"Gen.25.15"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gn 25:15"},") and others who were ruled by him and paid tribute to him. The people of Tema probably were descendants of Massa’s brother Tema."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"},{"c":["Massa forms part of the titles of ",{"href":"?bref=Pr.30.1","r":"Pr.30.1","rawR":"Pr.30.1","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Pr.30.1","value":"Pr.30.1"}],"t":"ref","v":"Proverbs 30:1"}," and ",{"href":"?bref=Pr.31.1","r":"Pr.31.1","rawR":"Pr.31.1","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Pr.31.1","value":"Pr.31.1"}],"t":"ref","v":"31:1"},". The definite article precedes it in ",{"href":"?bref=Pr.30.1","r":"Pr.30.1","rawR":"Pr.30.1","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Pr.30.1","value":"Pr.30.1"}],"t":"ref","v":"30:1"}," and can be translated “the burden” or “the oracle.” It is frequently used in prophetic passages in the ominous sense of God’s impending judgment (",{"href":"?bref=Isa.13.1","r":"Isa.13.1","rawR":"Isa.13.1","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Isa.13.1","value":"Isa.13.1"}],"t":"ref","v":"Is 13:1"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Nah.1.1","r":"Nah.1.1","rawR":"Nah.1.1","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Nah.1.1","value":"Nah.1.1"}],"t":"ref","v":"Na 1:1"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Hab.1.1","r":"Hab.1.1","rawR":"Hab.1.1","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Hab.1.1","value":"Hab.1.1"}],"t":"ref","v":"Hb 1:1"},")."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Massa","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Gn 25:14","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Gen.25.14","rawQueryValue":"Gen.25.14","sourceRefExact":"Gen.25.14"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 1:30","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.1.30","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.1.30","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.1.30"},{"anchorText":"Gn 25:15","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Gen.25.15","rawQueryValue":"Gen.25.15","sourceRefExact":"Gen.25.15"},{"anchorText":"Proverbs 30:1","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Pr.30.1","rawQueryValue":"Pr.30.1","sourceRefExact":"Pr.30.1"},{"anchorText":"31:1","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Pr.31.1","rawQueryValue":"Pr.31.1","sourceRefExact":"Pr.31.1"},{"anchorText":"30:1","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Pr.30.1","rawQueryValue":"Pr.30.1","sourceRefExact":"Pr.30.1"},{"anchorText":"Is 13:1","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Isa.13.1","rawQueryValue":"Isa.13.1","sourceRefExact":"Isa.13.1"},{"anchorText":"Na 1:1","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Nah.1.1","rawQueryValue":"Nah.1.1","sourceRefExact":"Nah.1.1"},{"anchorText":"Hb 1:1","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Hab.1.1","rawQueryValue":"Hab.1.1","sourceRefExact":"Hab.1.1"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"e77f2df0fd760ff2a0b2d9a0221322425abd9d3e9adba2a4582c62631c4ad955","sourceItemName":"Massa","sourceItemOrder":164,"sourceMember":"Articles/M.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Massa","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Massa","title":"Massa","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}